WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.576
A positive times a negative gives a negative; two negatives multiply to a positive.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:12.521
Calculate 4 times (5). The answer is 20. Equal signs produce positive; different

00:00:12.521 --> 00:00:14.855
signs produce negative. Result: 20.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:20.943
A number-line challenge in a craft workshop asks for the product of two signed

00:00:20.943 --> 00:00:25.812
numbers: -3 times (-7). What is the result? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:32.515
A number-line challenge in a craft workshop asks for the product of two signed

00:00:32.515 --> 00:00:38.835
numbers: -3 times (-7). What is the result? The answer is 21. Equal signs produce

00:00:38.835 --> 00:00:41.785
positive; different signs produce negative. Result: 21.
